    "Expect: GD02-040 in slot1 is rested (cost paid) and slot2 GD02-042 gets AP+2 during this turn (CARD_STAT_MODIFIED modifyAP delta=2).",
    "Action: Enter battle manually and attack enemy slot2 GD02-042 with your unprotected slot3 GD02-037; resolve battle.",
    "Expect: Your slot3 unit receives normal battle damage from an enemy HP2 unit (damageReceived increases by enemy AP), showing no prevention on slot3.",
    "Action: In the same turn, attack enemy slot1 GD02-042 with your protected slot2 GD02-042; resolve battle.",
    "Expect: Protected slot2 takes 0 battle damage from that enemy HP2 unit while still dealing battle damage to the defender (and should destroy it with AP boosted by Support 2).",
    "Action: End turn and pass priority to opponent.",
    "Expect: GD02-040 temporary effects expire at end of turn (slot2 no longer has AP+2 and no longer has the HP<=2 battle-damage prevention)."
  ],
